The package libtmux provides CMake targets:

    find_package(libtmux CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE libtmux::libtmux)

The private-tmux-server test fixture is a separate component, so a program that
does not ask for it never links it:

    find_package(libtmux CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS testing)
    target_link_libraries(my_tests PRIVATE libtmux::testing)
